    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/26848caa922311c0d42dcb127ae023f2.avif?t=1749766246\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span>Jamming in <i>Make a Hit!</i> is a new and <strong>addictive</strong> experience. Prepare to have your <strong>brain tickled</strong> as you successfully combine cassettes and powerful modifiers to accrue <strong>massive sales</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/726d3f9362250667d7400c3b32ac2cb6.poster.avif?t=1749766246\" width=800 height=563 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/726d3f9362250667d7400c3b32ac2cb6.webm?t=1749766246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/37fbde65f0748e71a8153f8ed3d892ee.webp?t=1749766246\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/8728a04a04a3209e0cfd57c99cbe0c71.avif?t=1749766246\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re bringing <strong>roguelike</strong> to <strong>the 80s</strong>. Cassettes, Vinyls and a distinct 80s style \u2014 It\u2019s all here, but we\u2019re keeping the beats <strong>fresh</strong> with our synthpop soundtrack to lean into modern sensibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/09ad4fd83778e8747e819d222e49dd88.poster.avif?t=1749766246\" width=559 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/09ad4fd83778e8747e819d222e49dd88.webm?t=1749766246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/39758fa6efffb16807f7224b1a0baaae.webp?t=1749766246\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/e3cac9286420d3083b004838bb3d2960.avif?t=1749766246\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match different samples to build <strong>your own music</strong>. What a banger! When you finish an album, let out your inner Picasso and <strong>craft album art</strong> for it! Let\u2019s see those creative masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/9c09d9091ae6999c31b0470ba8216898.poster.avif?t=1749766246\" width=575 height=385 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/9c09d9091ae6999c31b0470ba8216898.webm?t=1749766246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/26848caa922311c0d42dcb127ae023f2.avif?t=1749766246\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span>Jamming in <i>Make a Hit!</i> is a new and <strong>addictive</strong> experience. Prepare to have your <strong>brain tickled</strong> as you successfully combine cassettes and powerful modifiers to accrue <strong>massive sales</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/726d3f9362250667d7400c3b32ac2cb6.poster.avif?t=1749766246\" width=800 height=563 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/726d3f9362250667d7400c3b32ac2cb6.webm?t=1749766246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/37fbde65f0748e71a8153f8ed3d892ee.webp?t=1749766246\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/8728a04a04a3209e0cfd57c99cbe0c71.avif?t=1749766246\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re bringing <strong>roguelike</strong> to <strong>the 80s</strong>. Cassettes, Vinyls and a distinct 80s style \u2014 It\u2019s all here, but we\u2019re keeping the beats <strong>fresh</strong> with our synthpop soundtrack to lean into modern sensibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/09ad4fd83778e8747e819d222e49dd88.poster.avif?t=1749766246\" width=559 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/09ad4fd83778e8747e819d222e49dd88.webm?t=1749766246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/39758fa6efffb16807f7224b1a0baaae.webp?t=1749766246\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/e3cac9286420d3083b004838bb3d2960.avif?t=1749766246\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match different samples to build <strong>your own music</strong>. What a banger! When you finish an album, let out your inner Picasso and <strong>craft album art</strong> for it! Let\u2019s see those creative masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/9c09d9091ae6999c31b0470ba8216898.poster.avif?t=1749766246\" width=575 height=385 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/9c09d9091ae6999c31b0470ba8216898.webm?t=1749766246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Mix cassettes in this 80s puzzle roguelike to top the Billboard! Match attributes, combine modifiers, and manage cash to create hit songs and climb the charts. Collect vinyls, mix samples, and design album art on your path to musical stardom.",
